  "Name": "Linear eMerge E3-Series Access Controller Command Injection",
  "Description": "This module exploits a command injection vulnerability in the Linear eMerge E3-Series Access Controller. The Linear eMerge E3 versions `1.00-06` and below are vulnerable to unauthenticated command injection in card_scan_decoder.php via the `No` and `door` HTTP GET parameter. Successful exploitation results in command execution as the `root` user.",
